From b56f16e8037de886638fd1eb71bfbe7bc624f633 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Braun <sam@webry.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:21:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): a moved-on refusal ends the stop; one table per mark
 and label

reportFailure takes StopMovedOn to nextStop instead of listing again
(a list in MovedOn opens the new stop and answers Files, so the old
views looped). FileMark renders the name and its mark from one table;
summaryLabel walks one word table.

Refs #1422 #1423 #1424 #1425 #1426 #1435
